the dominant issues for women of the 20th century&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:16.560 --> 00:19:21.200
lack of access to education and professional&nbsp;
advancement if women were so excluded from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:21.200 --> 00:19:25.200
the public sphere how could they prevent&nbsp;
the world from slipping into another war&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:25.200 --> 00:19:30.560
according to wolfe exclusion of women led to&nbsp;
an unbridled patriarchal society which in turn&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:30.560 --> 00:19:36.400
had a direct link to the rise of fascism in europe&nbsp;
